25
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:27,500
もう笑えない 僕の アンデッドアリスへ
To my Undead Alice who can no longer smile.

26
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:45,000
ずっとこのまま ふたりで夢を見れるって
That we could keep dreaming together just like this...

27
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,000
勝手ばかりで 君はどんな顔で笑っていたっけ
Always acting on your own, what kind of face were you smiling with?

28
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:56,000
バイバイしたから 元通りなんて幻想だ
Since we said bye-bye, thinking things are back to normal is an illusion.

29
00:03:56,000 --> 00:04:03,000
まあまあツライじゃん 胸を割いて愛を潰してくれよ
Well, it's pretty painful—slice open my chest and crush this love.

